USER SUBMITS CLAIM
        ↓ (50ms - Instant)
API GATEWAY
  ├─ Validate input
  ├─ Generate claim_id  
  └─ Return "Claim received!"
        ↓ (ASYNC - User already happy)
ORCHESTRATION BACKEND (12 seconds)

  AGENT 1: INTAKE (2 sec)
  └─ Conversational collection
  └─ Asks for missing info
  
  AGENT 2: DOCUMENT (3 sec)
  └─ Vision model reads PDFs
  └─ Extracts: policy #, coverage, deductible
  
  AGENT 3: COVERAGE (1 sec)
  └─ Tool query to database
  └─ Verifies: is_covered? Yes/No
  
  AGENT 4: SEVERITY (4 sec)
  └─ GPT-4 structured JSON output
  └─ Severity: high/medium/low
  └─ Risk factors, missing info
        ↓
ROUTING ENGINE (1 sec)
  ├─ if not_covered → deny_queue
  ├─ elif missing_info → pending_docs_queue
  ├─ elif severity==critical → urgent_queue
  └─ else → standard_queue
        ↓
DATABASE STORE (0.5 sec)
  └─ Save to RDS (with replication)
        ↓
SEND TO CUSTOMER
  ├─ Email notification
  ├─ Add to claims team dashboard
  └─ Customer can check status anytime